    narr:narration """This position holds that day-old markdowns happen [mid-afternoon rather than at close, so buyers are still in the shop](narr:Expr_20261014_4_Batch2Bakery20261014023839_h173c1b0dd019_1), and that [the shelf card changes at the same moment so the till price is never a surprise](narr:Expr_20261014_4_Batch2Bakery20261014023839_h173c1b0dd019_2). The two members align: timing and card display move together, voiced in a market-pricing register with antithesis framing on the timing argument.""" ;
